{"seq":2,"slug":"liquidity-forecast","title":"多币种流动性预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/treasury-ops-liquidity/liquidity-forecast","wordCount":1972,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种流动性预测\">多币种流动性预测</h1><p>司库每天都面对一个朴素的问题：<strong>未来某一天，每个币种的钱够不够付</strong>。这个问题的难点不在于算总账——集团合计的现金通常充裕——而在于<strong>币种与实体的约束</strong>：美元余额再多也付不了日元应付，新加坡实体的钱不一定能划到巴西去用。多币种流动性预测做的就是按币种、按实体、按日期回答&quot;够不够&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-现金流的确定性分层\">核心概念：现金流的确定性分层</h2><p>预测的第一个动作不是建模，而是<strong>分类</strong>。每一笔未来现金流按它的确定性等级归入一层，各层的处理方式完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>确定层（certain）</strong>：已经确定金额与时点的现金流。已到期的应付账款、已签发的付款指令、有明确到期日的借款本息、已签订的供应商货款。这一层直接进入现金流曲线，没有预测误差。</p>\n<p><strong>合约层（contracted）</strong>：已签合约但金额或时点有条件的现金流。分期付款的采购合同、有最低保证量的商户结算、已签但未到期的定期存款到期。这一层的金额相对确定，时点可能需要按合同条款推算。</p>\n<p><strong>预测层（forecast）</strong>：没有合约支撑、基于历史与业务计划的现金流。未来销售回款、平台手续费收入、运营开支。这一层的误差最大，需要用统计方法建模并给出置信区间。</p>\n<p><strong>情景层（scenario）</strong>：依赖于特定条件才发生的现金流。极端市场情况下的客户集中提现、监管要求下的备付金追加、备用融资额度的提取。这一层不进日常预测，用于压力测试。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>确定性</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>误差处理</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确定</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>应付/指令系统</td>\n<td>无误差</td>\n<td>日度头寸管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>合同台账</td>\n<td>按条款推算</td>\n<td>周度资金计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>历史统计</td>\n<td>置信区间</td>\n<td>月度融资规划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情景</td>\n<td>条件</td>\n<td>压力模型</td>\n<td>情景概率</td>\n<td>限额与应急预案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分层不是分表-是分层标注\">分层不是分表，是分层标注</h3><p>一个常见的实现错误是把四层存成四张表。正确做法是<strong>一张现金流表 + 一个确定性等级字段</strong>，因为同一笔现金流可能在生命周期中从合约层升级到确定层（合同变成应收账款），分层变化是<strong>状态迁移</strong>而不是数据搬迁。用一个字段 + 状态迁移历史，能自然地表达这个过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多币种约束下的头寸计算\">多币种约束下的头寸计算</h2><p>单币种流动性预测是&quot;期初余额 + 期间流入 − 期间流出 ≥ 0&quot;。多币种场景下，这个式子必须<strong>逐币种独立成立</strong>，且要考虑币种间的可兑换性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Position</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Opening</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>Inflow</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Outflow</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Position}(c, t) = \\text{Opening}(c) + \\sum_{s \\le t} \\left(\\text{Inflow}(c,s) - \\text{Outflow}(c,s)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Position</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Opening</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Inflow</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Outflow</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>约束是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Position</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mtext>Buffer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Position}(c,t) \\ge \\text{Buffer}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Position</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Buffer</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Buffer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Buffer}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Buffer</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该币种的最低保留量。这个 Buffer 不是一个可以随意设的常数——它至少要覆盖：该币种在途支付的峰值、预测误差的上界、以及该币种无法快速补充的时延成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"币种间不能假设自由兑换\">币种间不能假设自由兑换</h3><p>只有在&quot;该币种可自由兑换、且能在需要的时点完成兑换与交割&quot;时，才可以考虑用另一个币种的余额来补。而实际上这受两个约束：<strong>资本管制</strong>（某些货币的兑换与汇出受限，见 <a href=\"../cash-position-exposure/multi-account-balance-sweeping\">多区域账户余额归集</a>）与<strong>交割时延</strong>（即期是 T+2，远水解不了近渴）。所以严谨的流动性模型应该把币种做<strong>弱分组</strong>：只有在同一&quot;可即时互换组&quot;内的币种才能互相支援。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;interchange_group&quot;: &quot;USD_EUR_GBP_JPY&quot;,&#10;  &quot;members&quot;: [&quot;USD&quot;, &quot;EUR&quot;, &quot;GBP&quot;, &quot;JPY&quot;],&#10;  &quot;convertibility&quot;: &quot;FREE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;settlement_lag_days&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;note&quot;: &quot;组内可互换但须考虑T+2交割时延，仅对t+2之后的缺口有效&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"interchange_group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD_EUR_GBP_JPY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"members\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GBP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JPY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"convertibility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FREE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settlement_lag_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"组内可互换但须考虑T+2交割时延，仅对t+2之后的缺口有效\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交割时延决定支援的有效范围\">交割时延决定支援的有效范围</h3><p><code>settlement_lag_days</code> 是关键字段：如果今天发现后天有日元缺口，可以用美元换日元来补（T+2 交割正好赶上）；如果是明天的缺口，换汇来不及，只能用已有日元。这个约束让流动性预测的<strong>时间粒度</strong>与<strong>可支援范围</strong>直接挂钩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测误差与-buffer-的设定\">预测误差与 Buffer 的设定</h2><p>预测层的误差是流动性风险的主要来源。处理误差有三种思路，实践中通常组合使用。</p>\n<p><strong>置信区间法</strong>：用历史预测误差的分布给出分位数。如果 90 分位的预测误差是 −15%，那么预测流入 1000 万时，保守假设是 850 万。这个方法的优点是直接给出保守值，缺点是假设误差分布稳定——业务结构变化时历史分布会失效。</p>\n<p><strong>滚动偏差校正</strong>：持续跟踪实际值与预测值的偏差，用偏差的移动平均校正下一期预测。这个方法能自动吸收趋势性偏差（比如销售持续低于预期），但对突发变化反应慢。</p>\n<p><strong>情景叠加</strong>：在基准预测上叠加压力情景（大客户流失、季节性低谷、极端汇率），检查在这些情景下 Buffer 是否仍然够。这是应急预案的输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"buffer-要按币种设而非按总量设\">Buffer 要按币种设而非按总量设</h3><p>一个诱人的简化是&quot;给集团设一个总 Buffer&quot;，但这是错的——日元缺口不能用多余的美元 Buffer 来覆盖（交割时延 + 兑换成本）。Buffer 必须逐币种设定，且逐币种设定后加总得到的集团 Buffer 会明显高于按总量设定的值。这个差额就是多币种运营的真实成本，必须被承认而不是被优化掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测的执行与回测\">预测的执行与回测</h2><p>流动性预测是一个每天跑、且必须与事实验证闭环的过程。回测的机制是：把历史上某一天的预测结果保存为快照，等实际发生时对比，计算<strong>逐时点的预测偏差</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE liquidity_forecast (&#10;  forecast_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  as_of          TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES legal_entity(id),&#10;  ccy            CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  horizon_date   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  certainty_tier TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (certainty_tier IN (&#39;CERTAIN&#39;,&#39;CONTRACTED&#39;,&#39;FORECAST&#39;,&#39;SCENARIO&#39;)),&#10;  projected_net  NUMERIC(28,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  buffer_required NUMERIC(28,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  is_breach      BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  model_version  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE (as_of, entity_id, ccy, horizon_date, certainty_tier, model_version)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> liquidity_forecast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  forecast_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  as_of          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legal_entity(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ccy            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  horizon_date   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certainty_tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (certainty_tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CERTAIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONTRACTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FORECAST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SCENARIO'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  projected_net  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buffer_required </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_breach      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (as_of, entity_id, ccy, horizon_date, certainty_tier, model_version)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"model_version-是回测的前提\">model_version 是回测的前提</h3><p>没有 <code>model_version</code>，回测无法区分&quot;预测错了&quot;和&quot;模型换了&quot;。每一次模型变更都必须递增版本，回测按版本分组计算偏差，才能判断新模型是否真的更好。</p>\n<h3 id=\"is_breach-要在生成时就计算\">is_breach 要在生成时就计算</h3><p><code>is_breach</code> 表示该时点该币种的预计头寸是否低于 Buffer。把它在生成时就物化，而不是查询时计算，是因为它是一个<strong>需要被主动告警的事件</strong>：一旦某个币种在未来 14 天内的任意时点预计突破 Buffer，就应该触发资金调度动作（加速收款、安排融资、调整付款节奏），而不是等缺口真的到来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[收集现金流 分层标注] --&gt; B[确定层 直接入曲线]&#10;    A --&gt; C[合约层 按条款推算时点]&#10;    A --&gt; D[预测层 统计模型+置信区间]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用滚动偏差校正]&#10;    B --&gt; F[逐币种逐日头寸曲线]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{Position &gt;= Buffer}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[无动作 记录]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[检查可互换组能否支援]&#10;    I --&gt;|组内可支援 且交割时延允许| J[安排换汇 修补缺口]&#10;    I --&gt;|不可支援| K[触发调度 加速收款/融资/推迟付款]&#10;    J --&gt; L[更新预测 记录处置]&#10;    K --&gt; L&#10;    L --&gt; M[回测闭环 对比实际]\">graph TD\n    A[收集现金流 分层标注] --&gt; B[确定层 直接入曲线]\n    A --&gt; C[合约层 按条款推算时点]\n    A --&gt; D[预测层 统计模型+置信区间]\n    D --&gt; E[用滚动偏差校正]\n    B --&gt; F[逐币种逐日头寸曲线]\n    C --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{Position &gt;= Buffer}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[无动作 记录]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[检查可互换组能否支援]\n    I --&gt;|组内可支援 且交割时延允许| J[安排换汇 修补缺口]\n    I --&gt;|不可支援| K[触发调度 加速收款/融资/推迟付款]\n    J --&gt; L[更新预测 记录处置]\n    K --&gt; L\n    L --&gt; M[回测闭环 对比实际]</pre><h3 id=\"可支援组的判定要包含交割时延\">可支援组的判定要包含交割时延</h3><p><code>检查可互换组能否支援</code> 这一步必须同时检查两件事：组内是否有富余币种，以及富余币种换成缺口币种能否在缺口时点之前完成交割。只看&quot;组内有富余&quot;是不够的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现金流按确定性分四层（确定、合约、预测、情景），分层是同一张表上的状态迁移而非四张表。</li>\n<li>多币种头寸必须逐币种独立满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Position</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>Buffer</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Position} \\ge \\text{Buffer}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Position</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span>；币种间只在&quot;可即时互换组&quot;内且交割时延允许时才可互相支援。</li>\n<li>预测误差用置信区间、滚动偏差校正、情景叠加三种手段处理；Buffer 必须逐币种设定，其加总高于总量 Buffer 的差额是多币种运营的真实成本。</li>\n<li><code>model_version</code> 是回测的前提；<code>is_breach</code> 应在生成时物化以便主动告警，而不是查询时临时计算。</li>\n<li>预测必须与事实验证闭环：保存历史预测快照，实际发生后逐时点对比偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种流动性预测","id":"多币种流动性预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：现金流的确定性分层","id":"核心概念-现金流的确定性分层"},{"level":3,"text":"分层不是分表，是分层标注","id":"分层不是分表-是分层标注"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种约束下的头寸计算","id":"多币种约束下的头寸计算"},{"level":3,"text":"币种间不能假设自由兑换","id":"币种间不能假设自由兑换"},{"level":3,"text":"交割时延决定支援的有效范围","id":"交割时延决定支援的有效范围"},{"level":2,"text":"预测误差与 Buffer 的设定","id":"预测误差与-buffer-的设定"},{"level":3,"text":"Buffer 要按币种设而非按总量设","id":"buffer-要按币种设而非按总量设"},{"level":2,"text":"预测的执行与回测","id":"预测的执行与回测"},{"level":3,"text":"model_version 是回测的前提","id":"model_version-是回测的前提"},{"level":3,"text":"is_breach 要在生成时就计算","id":"is_breach-要在生成时就计算"},{"level":3,"text":"可支援组的判定要包含交割时延","id":"可支援组的判定要包含交割时延"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内部银行与资金池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/treasury-ops-liquidity/in-house-cash-pool"},"next":{"title":"司库对账与审计留痕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/treasury-ops-liquidity/treasury-reconcile-audit"}}